tweets.text:
FEMA STANDS WITH MISSISSIPPIANS. 

Secretary Noem was in Mississippi on Monday with Governor Reeves to deliver help to those affected by this unprecedented weather event.

@Sec_Noem’s implementation of a new block grant system has allowed @fema to more effectively disperse aid to states ahead of disasters like this recent winter storm. When there’s a disaster that’s coming, we pre-deploy personnel and dollars so there is no delay in tackling the work of protecting and healing our communities.

